NOTE ON REFERENCE DATA

This license covers the RockMin ID source code only. Geochemical reference
data obtained from GEOROC (DIGIS, Georg-August-Universitaet Goettingen),
EarthChem/PetDB (IEDA), Mindat.org, RRUFF and the USGS remains subject to the
terms and citation requirements of those providers. Users redistributing or
publishing results derived from those datasets must cite them accordingly.
No bulk reference data is included in this repository.
